; ERASERECT width height paints a rectangle centered on the turtle in
; the canvas's background color -- a punch-out, not a draw.

REPEAT 4 [FD 150 RT 90]
PENUP
SETXY 325 175
PENDOWN
SETPENCOLOR 0 150 255
FILL

; Erase a hole out of the middle of the square just filled.
PENUP
SETXY 325 175
PENDOWN
ERASERECT 60 60

; Like FILL, ERASERECT freezes at the moment it's called: a line drawn
; afterward through the erased hole doesn't retroactively undo it, and
; doesn't get erased either -- it draws right through where the hole is.
PENUP
SETXY 250 175
PENDOWN
SETXY 400 175
